Cell["\<\
LPPLS model implementation (2026 ed.) for Gold price in USD.
Uses PAXG price as a proxy for Gold\[CloseCurlyQuote]s price, due to current \
lack of access to high quality (hourly) Spot Gold price data.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"fd6c9b7a-a612-48d5-8d00-523111e52e31"],

